      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The efficacy of physiotherapeutic methods in association with preliminary aspirin intakes was examined in 276 patients with ischemic heart disease. Results indicate that the main clinicofunctional and laboratory indices showed a positive dynamics. The above treatment is considered perspective in the restorative treatment and secondary prophylaxis of patients with ischemic heart disease."},
